        "reason": "9 component(s) colour slotted text through the <slot> element (p-button-pure, p-drilldown-link, p-link-pure, p-text, p-heading). Computed style on the host reports a different colour, so contrast results for this text \u2014 including axe-core's \u2014 may be wrong in either direction.",
